#: about.cpp:56
msgid ""
"<p>Ksetiwatch monitors multiple <a "
"href=\"http://setiathome.ssl.berkeley.edu/index.html\">SETI@home</a> "
"instances running on your computer or in your network. It shares the same "
"look-and-feel of the popular <a "
"href=\"http://members.shaw.ca/mloukko/SETI.html\">SETIWatch</a> "
"tool for the Windows platforms, written by Mark Loukko.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ksetiwatch vixia várias instáncias de <a "
"href=\"http://setiathome.ssl.berkeley.edu/index.html\">SETI@home</a> "
"en execuzón no seu ordenador ou na sua rede. Este comparte a mesma aparéncia e "
"comportamento da famosa ferramenta <a "
"href=\"http://members.shaw.ca/mloukko/SETI.html\">SETIWatch</a> "
"para as plataformas Windows, criada por Mark Loukko.</p>"

#: about.cpp:62
msgid ""
"<p>To make full use of this program, the latest version of the SETI@home client "
"is required. Command-line clients for various platforms can be found <a "
"href=\"http://setiathome.ssl.berkeley.edu/unix.html\">here</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Para sacar-lle todo o partido a este programa, é necesária a última versión "
"do cliente de SETI@home. Os clientes de liña de comandos para várias "
"plataformas poden ser encontrados <a "
"href=\"http://setiathome.ssl.berkeley.edu/unix.html\">aqui</a>.</p>"

#: about.cpp:65
msgid ""
